## Security Notice

This software is designed for authorized security testing and reconnaissance
purposes only. Users must ensure they have proper authorization before testing
any systems or networks. Unauthorized use of this software is strictly
prohibited and may violate local, state, and federal laws.

## Responsible Use

By using this software, you agree to:

1. Use it only on systems you own or have explicit written permission to test
2. Comply with all applicable laws and regulations
3. Respect rate limits and terms of service of third-party services
4. Not use it for malicious purposes or to cause harm
5. Report any vulnerabilities discovered responsibly
6. Handle any data collected in accordance with applicable privacy laws

